{"about_the_game":"Step into your own little perfume workshop, where every bottle tells a story. \ud83c\udf38 Mix fragrant essences, design beautiful bottles, and share your creations with curious customers who are searching for scents that match their mood. As your atelier grows, decorate your space, unlock new recipes, and build your reputation in the gentle art of fragrance.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Cozy Crafting</h2>Choose from a wide library of essences, each with its own traits. Mix and match to create perfumes that carry distinct moods, accords, and tones. Every drop counts, so use your ingredients wisely.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Bottle Design</h2>Express yourself through bottle shapes, caps, labels, and colors. There\u2019s no wrong way to design, each creation is uniquely yours.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Shopkeeping</h2>Welcome curious customers with their own requests and quirks. Wrap bottles, prepare testers, and match perfumes to their tastes. Build a reputation for thoughtfulness and creativity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Progression &amp; Discovery</h2>Unlock new essences, recipes, and decorative elements as you grow. Meet the mysterious traveling merchant, take on special orders, and collect rare labels for your perfumes.<br><br>Will your atelier become a treasured stop in the neighborhood, known for perfumes that match not just a scent, but a feeling?  <br><strong>\ud83d\udc96 If you\u2019d like to support the game, don\u2019t forget to add Perfume Atelier to your Wishlist!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/611476eb17f6c9452c30d60d630da599.avif?t=1757914766\" data-has-big width=1560 height=461 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962270?t=1757914766","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962270?t=1757914766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/d4e72d1844cd833af3f767d9f8bfe3ef25526a93/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757914766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/d4e72d1844cd833af3f767d9f8bfe3ef25526a93/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757914766","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist &amp; Play the demo first! \u2728</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/611476eb17f6c9452c30d60d630da599.avif?t=1757914766\" data-has-big width=1560 height=461 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Step into your own little perfume workshop, where every bottle tells a story. \ud83c\udf38 Mix fragrant essences, design beautiful bottles, and share your creations with curious customers who are searching for scents that match their mood. As your atelier grows, decorate your space, unlock new recipes, and build your reputation in the gentle art of fragrance.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Cozy Crafting</h2>Choose from a wide library of essences, each with its own traits. Mix and match to create perfumes that carry distinct moods, accords, and tones. Every drop counts, so use your ingredients wisely.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Bottle Design</h2>Express yourself through bottle shapes, caps, labels, and colors. There\u2019s no wrong way to design, each creation is uniquely yours.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Shopkeeping</h2>Welcome curious customers with their own requests and quirks. Wrap bottles, prepare testers, and match perfumes to their tastes. Build a reputation for thoughtfulness and creativity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Progression &amp; Discovery</h2>Unlock new essences, recipes, and decorative elements as you grow. Meet the mysterious traveling merchant, take on special orders, and collect rare labels for your perfumes.<br><br>Will your atelier become a treasured stop in the neighborhood, known for perfumes that match not just a scent, but a feeling?  <br><strong>\ud83d\udc96 If you\u2019d like to support the game, don\u2019t forget to add Perfume Atelier to your Wishlist!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/611476eb17f6c9452c30d60d630da599.avif?t=1757914766\" data-has-big width=1560 height=461 /></span>","developers":[" Keep The Engine Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/f96b229cc88688070f9e62ee04a3ad7ec2e734e6/header.jpg?t=1757914766","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 - Keep The Engine Games, Published by Rogue Duck Interactive LLC and Co-published in Asia Regions (China, Korea, Japan) by Gamersky Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04, SteamOS (Proton-8 Recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.7 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 8 or higher, ATI X1600 or higher, or Intel HD 3000 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> OpenAL Compatible Sound Card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Proton-8 Recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}